{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/206440/extras/38a11a6af0a569870436ef0b90820613.avif?t=1770793830\" width=1034 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Rosalene and Dr. Watts have peculiar jobs: They give people another chance to live, all the way from the very beginning... but only in their patients' heads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/206440/extras/c8483bafba49458197a198479d5b6cbf.avif?t=1770793830\" width=432 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to the severity of the operation, the new life becomes the last thing the patients remember before drawing their last breath. Thus, the operation is only done to people on their deathbeds, to fulfill what they wish they had done with their lives, but didn\u2019t. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This particular story follows their attempt to fulfill the dream of an elderly man, Johnny. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/206440/extras/cd4421b4cb6bde75733a24e1bfb8a646.avif?t=1770793830\" width=1034 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each step back in time, a new fragment of Johnny's past is revealed. As the two doctors piece together the puzzled events that spanned a life time, they seek to find out just why the frail old man chose his dying wish to be what it is. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And Johnny's last wish is, of course... to go to the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/206440/extras/3aa4483aa3dd306746391ac7d36f675f.avif?t=1770793830\" width=792 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique &amp; non-combat story-driven experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative mix between adventure game elements and classic RPG aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acclaimed original soundtrack that closely ties to the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An espresso execution with zero filler and no time drains</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\"Wish Granted\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/206440/45f30af066061beda28b04d10400ea550416193c.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/206440?t=1770793830","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/206440?t=1770793830","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/206440/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770793830","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/206440/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770793830","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/206440/extras/38a11a6af0a569870436ef0b90820613.avif?t=1770793830\" width=1034 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Rosalene and Dr. Watts have peculiar jobs: They give people another chance to live, all the way from the very beginning... but only in their patients' heads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/206440/extras/c8483bafba49458197a198479d5b6cbf.avif?t=1770793830\" width=432 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to the severity of the operation, the new life becomes the last thing the patients remember before drawing their last breath. Thus, the operation is only done to people on their deathbeds, to fulfill what they wish they had done with their lives, but didn\u2019t. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This particular story follows their attempt to fulfill the dream of an elderly man, Johnny. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/206440/extras/cd4421b4cb6bde75733a24e1bfb8a646.avif?t=1770793830\" width=1034 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each step back in time, a new fragment of Johnny's past is revealed. As the two doctors piece together the puzzled events that spanned a life time, they seek to find out just why the frail old man chose his dying wish to be what it is. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And Johnny's last wish is, of course... to go to the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/206440/extras/3aa4483aa3dd306746391ac7d36f675f.avif?t=1770793830\" width=792 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique &amp; non-combat story-driven experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative mix between adventure game elements and classic RPG aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acclaimed original soundtrack that closely ties to the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An espresso execution with zero filler and no time drains</p></li></ul>","developers":["Freebird Games"],"dlc":[1028420,206450,338250,339550,418890],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/206440/header.jpg?t=1770793830","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Major Linux Distribution from 2010<br>        </li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.0 capable graphics card<br>        </li><li><strong>Hard Drive:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS X 10.6.8<br>        </li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.0 capable graphics card<br>        </li><li><strong>Hard Drive:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"metacritic":{"score":81,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/to-the-moon?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/206440/171680/f0baf6d86a109b64afa2b67a6e75464d0363ee93/1751249066/dash_av1.mpd?t=1530767608","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/206440/171680/f0baf6d86a109b64afa2b67a6e75464d0363ee93/1751249066/dash_h264.mpd?t=1530767608","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/206440/171680/f0baf6d86a109b64afa2b67a6e75464d0363ee93/1751249066/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1530767608","id":256721880,"name":"To the Moon - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256721880/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1530767608"}],"name":"To the Moon","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_licens